---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="KTU — CGPA Calculator AI" description="KTU SGPA and CGPA calculator for 2024, 2019 and 2015 schemes. Grade table S/A+/A/B+/B/C+/C/D/P/F, failed credits stay in denominator, percentage = CGPA × 10 (2024) or CGPA × 10 − 2.5 (2019 original). Not affiliated with KTU." pathname="/ktu">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width: 800px;">
      <p class="eyebrow" style="margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-xs) 0;">University • KTU</p>
      <h1 class="heading-lg" style="margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);">KTU CGPA &amp; SGPA Calculator</h1>
      <p class="body-md" style="margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md); max-width: 64ch;">
        Calculate SGPA and CGPA for APJ Abdul Kalam Technological University (KTU) under 2024, 2019 and 2015 schemes. KTU uses a 10-point grade scale; failed courses (F/FE/Ab/I) earn 0 points and their credits STAY in the SGPA and CGPA denominators.
      </p>

      <div class="feature-card" style="margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);">
        <h2 class="heading-md" style="margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-sm) 0;">Supported schemes</h2>
        <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: var(--spacing-lg); color: var(--color-text);">
          <li style="margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xs);"><strong>KTU 2024 Scheme</strong> — grades S (10), A+ (9), A (8.5), B+ (8), B (7.5), C+ (7), C (6.5), D (6), P (5.5), F (0), FE (0), Ab (0). Percentage = CGPA × 10.</li>
          <li style="margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xs);"><strong>KTU 2019 Scheme</strong> — same grade table. Percentage = CGPA × 10 per the June 2023 amendment (U.O.No. 1584/2023/KTU); original regulation text stated CGPA × 10 − 2.5 (shown as an alternative — confirm with KTU).</li>
          <li style="margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xs);"><strong>KTU 2015 Scheme</strong> — official regulation PDF not located; all rules unverified. Calculator page not generated until confirmed.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-card" style="margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);">
        <h2 class="heading-md" style="margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-sm) 0;">Grade table — KTU 2024 / 2019</h2>
        <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: var(--font-size-body-sm);">
          <thead>
            <tr style="text-align: left;">
              <th style="padding: var(--spacing-xs); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border); color: var(--color-text-muted);">Grade</th>
              <th style="padding: var(--spacing-xs); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border); color: var(--color-text-muted); text-align: right;">Grade point</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);"><td style="padding: var(--spacing-xs); font-family: var(--font-family-mono);">S</td><td style="padding: var(--spacing-xs); text-align: right;">10</td></tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);"><td style="padding: var(--spacing-xs); font-family: var(--font-family-mono);">A+</td><td style="padding: var(--spacing-xs); text-align: right;">9</td></tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);"><td style="padding: var(--spacing-xs); font-family: var(--font-family-mono);">A</td><td style="padding: var(--spacing-xs); text-align: right;">8.5</td></tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);"><td style="padding: var(--spacing-xs); font-family: var(--font-family-mono);">B+</td><td style="padding: var(--spacing-xs); text-align: right;">8</td></tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);"><td style="padding: var(--spacing-xs); font-family: var(--font-family-mono);">B</td><td style="padding: var(--spacing-xs); text-align: right;">7.5</td></tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);"><td style="padding: var(--spacing-xs); font-family: var(--font-family-mono);">C+</td><td style="padding: var(--spacing-xs); text-align: right;">7</td></tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);"><td style="padding: var(--spacing-xs); font-family: var(--font-family-mono);">C</td><td style="padding: var(--spacing-xs); text-align: right;">6.5</td></tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);"><td style="padding: var(--spacing-xs); font-family: var(--font-family-mono);">D</td><td style="padding: var(--spacing-xs); text-align: right;">6</td></tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);"><td style="padding: var(--spacing-xs); font-family: var(--font-family-mono);">P</td><td style="padding: var(--spacing-xs); text-align: right;">5.5</td></tr>
            <tr><td style="padding: var(--spacing-xs); font-family: var(--font-family-mono);">F / FE / Ab</td><td style="padding: var(--spacing-xs); text-align: right;">0</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-card">
        <h2 class="heading-md" style="margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-sm) 0;">Key rules</h2>
        <ul style="margin: 0; padding-left: var(--spacing-lg); color: var(--color-text); font-size: var(--font-size-body-sm);">
          <li style="margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xs);">SGPA = Σ(Ci × GPi) ÷ Σ(Ci) over ALL courses of the semester, including F/FE/Ab/I with 0 points. Credits of failed courses stay in the denominator.</li>
          <li style="margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xs);">CGPA counts failed courses (0 points). Lateral entry: first and second semester credits are not counted.</li>
          <li style="margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xs);">Excluded from SGPA/CGPA: Minor, Honours, Challenge-exam credits; mandatory student activity credits.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div style="margin-top: var(--spacing-lg); display: flex; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
        <a href="/ktu/2024/cse/sgpa" class="button-primary">KTU 2024 CSE SGPA</a>
        <a href="/ktu/2019/cse/sgpa" class="button-secondary">KTU 2019 CSE SGPA</a>
        <a href="/universities" class="button-ghost-sm">All universities</a>
      </div>

      <p class="body-xs mute" style="margin-top: var(--spacing-lg);">
        CGPA Calculator AI is not affiliated with KTU. The 2015 scheme is unverified and has no calculator page until the official regulation is confirmed. Verify with ktu.edu.in before relying on results.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
